{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713690/extras/3a903d40a8452bb37a1f1571c7a28e61.avif?t=1772208083\" width=1560 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shattered Minds</strong> is an open-world visual novel where you step into the life of a young man gifted with an extraordinary superpower: the ability to influence the thoughts of others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With this newfound power, your world is turned upside down \u2014 offering you the chance to fulfill your desires, shape your destiny, and leave your mark on an entire town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there's a catch. A mighty power like yours never comes without a downside... </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713690/extras/5cc0593ce8a54a218971ffcbb4d56eb7.avif?t=1772208083\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an open world where each character goes about their daily routine.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to you which quests to pursue and whose path you want to influence first. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your harem</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713690/extras/fbb8fc3284ceae4bafd6c8f14ab6ce3c.avif?t=1772208083\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the harem of your dreams! Let your girls assist you\u2014have them generate resources, choose their outfits, enjoy intimate moments with them, live together, or even impregnate them if you wish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every girl is unique</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"